@fact grimsby.books
# en: Keeps the village bookshop. He will find anything except what you came in for.
text [034041] = 开着村里的书店。你要什么他都找得到，唯独找不到你进门要的那本。

@fact grimsby.wrong
# en: The book he gives you instead is, more often than not, the one you needed.
text [2be71b] = 他塞给你的那本“错书”，多半正是你需要的。

@fact grimsby.parcels
# en: He posts books to students he thinks need them, on credit, and has never once chased a debt.
text [5362f8] = 他会把他觉得学生需要的书赊账寄过去，从没催过一次债。

@fact grimsby.lighthouses
# en: He has a weakness for lighthouses, and when he closes the shop, it is usually to go and look at one.
text [f1d0ca] = 他对灯塔情有独钟；他关店的时候，通常就是去看某座灯塔了。
